NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENSE

This license covers the code, the evaluation harness and the golden question
set. It does not and cannot cover the game content this project reads:

- `data/parsed/rulebook.md` is a transcription of the *Slay the Spire: The
  Board Game* rulebook. The rulebook is copyright Contention Games and its
  licensors. It is included here for the narrow purpose of demonstrating and
  evaluating the retrieval pipeline, and is not licensed for redistribution or
  any other use.
- `data/cards-compendium.md` is a fan transcription of card faces. The card
  text is likewise the publisher's.
- `data/source/` is gitignored precisely because the source PDF is not ours to
  redistribute.

If you fork this to build on it, point it at a rulebook you have the right to
use. Nothing in the pipeline is specific to this game.
